OL,3,GNEWSAQueue of 100 hopefuls 'shows how
OL,4,Athe job market is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 hopefuls descended on a
OL,7,FManchester cafe to apply for a
OL,8,Fpart-time barista role in person after
OL,9,Fwhat the manager described as a
OL,10,F"whirlwind" of interest for previous
OL,11,Fjobs.
OL,13,FApplicants were invited to attend the
OL,14,FFig & Sparrow in the city's Northern
OL,15,FQuarter to present their CVs rather
OL,16,Fthan simply apply online after more
OL,17,Fthan 400 emails were received for a
OL,18,Fvacancy earlier in the year.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
