OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1792679199
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAQueue of 100 hopefuls 'shows how
OL,4,Athe job market is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeneral manager Luke Taylor, 32, said
OL,7,Fhe wanted to meet people face-to-face
OL,8,Fand added: "It shows how the job market
OL,9,Fis at the minute.
OL,11,F"People are turning up on a random
OL,12,FTuesday in a cafe that they have
OL,13,Fprobably never been to, hoping for the
OL,14,Fbest."
